# ==============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages Proxy Configuration (_redirects)
# ==============================================================================
# When you deploy your backend (e.g. Render, Railway, Fly.io, Cloud Run, or VPS),
# replace YOUR_BACKEND_URL with your live backend domain (e.g. https://cdc-api.onrender.com).
#
# Status code 200 creates a seamless transparent proxy (rewrite) without changing
# the browser's address bar or triggering CORS issues.
# ==============================================================================

# /ask https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/ask 200
# /api/* https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/api/:splat 200
# /admin https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/admin 200
# /admin/* https://YOUR_BACKEND_URL/admin/:splat 200
